# Instructor planning material. Participants clone this repo -- the demo plan,
# the PRDs and the infrastructure spec describe the planted defect, the
# rejection moment and the delivery script. Shipping them would tell a table
# exactly what is meant to surprise them.
docs/v1/
docs/v2/
docs/CV-NUS_*

# Same reason, and the worst offender: fast-path.md carries every D0-D9
# value with its reasoning, and review-example-answers.md gives away the
# planted defect. Both sat on every table branch. The material now lives on
# the `instructor` branch; keeping the directory ignored means it can also sit
# here locally without ever being committed back.
docs/instructor/
